---
source: crates/mydiff-tui/src/view.rs
expression: screen(&a)
---
"┌ keys ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│j k / ↓ ↑ / wheel                down / up                                    │"
"│PgDn Space Ctrl-d / PgUp Ctrl-u  page down / up                               │"
"│g Home / G End                   top / bottom                                 │"
"│]c / [c p                        next / prev change                           │"
"│h ← / l →                        scroll left / right                          │"
"│/ ?                              search fwd / back (\c ignores case)          │"
"│n / N                            next / prev match (N goes the opposite way)  │"
"│Tab Ctrl-w w / Ctrl-w h ← / l →  active pane (searches look only here)        │"
"│w                                whitespace (exact → trailing → change → all) │"
"│i                                ignore case                                  │"
"│b                                ignore blank lines                           │"
"│e                                ignore line endings (CRLF vs LF)             │"
"│u                                layout                                       │"
"│F1                               toggle this sidebar (remembered between runs)│"
"│:                                command line (commands below)                │"
"│q / Esc                          quit or go back (Esc closes :help first)     │"
"│Ctrl-c                           quit from anywhere                           │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│ removed  added  modified changed text ignored                                │"
"│search: match current match  active pane marked ▶                             │"
"│:help this list  :sidebar [left|right]  :noh :q :qa                           │"
"└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
" [w]s:exact [i]case:off [b]lank:off … -1 +1 ~1  2 changes  F1:keys :help q:quit "
